# OpenCode plugin layer is Bun-canonical (ADR-009 + audit Phase 0 P0-2).
# Source-of-truth files that MUST be tracked: package.json, bun.lock,
# tsconfig.json, plus every .ts under plugins/. Everything else is
# build/runtime detritus.
node_modules/
# package-lock.json may appear on disk if the operator runs `npm install`
# for diagnostic purposes, but npm is not the CI / runtime contract and
# this artifact must not enter git history.
package-lock.json
